      "context_excerpt": "Healthcare has a more severe labor shortage than any other field — the industry is expected to be short 10 million workers by the end of the decade, according to the World Health Organization . By deploying foundation models to narrow the field of potential drug molecules and streamlining workflows with agentic AI , these innovators are helping meet the global demand by enabling clinicians and researchers to achieve more with their limited time.",
